      "sourceTextSha256": "ae1fba6088871c5306745af7f7bb2696fa3a4df58a5bf0ccf17dc71447555e9f",
      "text": "Torres del Paine & Milodon Cave (full-day)\n\n09:00 We are ready at reception for a 40 min walk to board the boat to the grey glacier navigation.\n\nAn amazing adventure to the glacier is expecting us coming really near the Grey Glacier.\n\nAfter the return to the hotel we start our tour to  Laguna Sofía, Cordillera Prat, Lake Porteño, Cerro Mesa, Lago del Toro. We will continue visiting the visit of this beautiful national park and make a stop at the viewpoint of the Pehoe Lake. From here we can hike to the big 18m waterfall Salto Afterwards, visit the viewpoints of Lake Nordenskjöld, Laguna Amarga, Mirador Lake Sarmiento and return to the hotel in the evening.\n\nIncludes: Torres del Paine and navigation entrance fees, Lunch",
